        "postingDate": "Dec 08, 2023 12:00:00 AM EST",
        "forecastDesc": "<p>The purpose of this funding opportunity announcement (FOA) is to fund innovative research that will strengthen and advance minority health and health equity objectives.</p><p>Areas of interest include:</p><p>Proposals that focus on advancing equity in clinical trials by supporting efforts to advance diversity in clinical trials, equitable data efforts by increasing data available on diverse groups including, but not limited to, ethnicity, race, age, disability and geography, and equity of voices by increasing understanding of diverse patient perspectives, preferences, and unmet needs.&nbsp;</p>",
